+### Assign a ticket: `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee`
+
+```json
+{ "assignee": "sam" }
+```
+
+Assigns the ticket to an agent: a name of 1 to 64 characters on one line. `{ "assignee": null }` unassigns it. Answers 200
+with the ticket. Only `open` and `in_progress` tickets can be assigned or unassigned; any other is 409 `conflict`. Giving
+the ticket the assignee it already has changes nothing: no audit entry, no notification. The agent is notified that the
+ticket was assigned to them; unassigning notifies no one.
+
